    <bpmn:process id="W_W4337" name="W4337. Live-Goods &amp; Garden Center Strategy, Assortment &amp; Seasonal Calendar" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual category plan; seasonal cycle; performance review
Frequency: Annual + seasonal cycles
Volume: ~1,050 live-goods SKUs across 200 store garden centers
Owner: Garden Buyer / Merchandising (VS-01) / Garden Ops
Participants: Merchandising (VS-01), Store Ops (VS-07), Supply (VS-02), Marketing (VS-14), Vendor (VS-03)
Source: workflow W4337 — Live-Goods &amp; Garden Center Strategy, Assortment &amp; Seasonal Calendar</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4337_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4337_Lane1" name="Garden Buyer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4337_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4337_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4337_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4337_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4337_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4337_Start3" name="Annual category plan; seasonal cycle; performance review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4337_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4337_Task4" name="Garden Buyer/Merch set the live-goods strategy &amp; assortment — core/perennial…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Garden Buyer/Merch set the live-goods strategy &amp; assortment — core/perennial range, seasonal event range (poinsettias ber-months, Valentine, Holy Week, rainy-season), and the regional/climate fit (Mindanao vs Luzon)
Responsible (R): Garden Buyer / Merch
Accountable (A): Head of Merch
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4337_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4337_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4337_Task5" name="Garden Buyer/Supply build the seasonal calendar (sow/grow/land/peak/clear…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Garden Buyer/Supply build the seasonal calendar (sow/grow/land/peak/clear windows) aligned to grower lead times and store capacity, and size seasonal buy against forecast
Responsible (R): Garden Buyer / Supply
Accountable (A): Head of Merch
Duration: Per season</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4337_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4337_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4337_Task6" name="Merch/Ops document the strategy, cascade to sourcing (W4338), pricing/markdown…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Merch/Ops document the strategy, cascade to sourcing (W4338), pricing/markdown (W4341), and seasonal promo (W4344)
Responsible (R): Garden Buyer / Merch
Accountable (A): Head of Merch
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4337_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4337_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4337_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4337_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4337_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-665 (ensure controlled execution — Live-Goods Assortment, Sourcing &amp; Nursery Operations (PA-145.1).) | - CTL-665: assortment region/climate-fit; seasonal calendar aligned to lead times; buy sized to forecast
Owner: Garden Buyer / Merchandising (VS-01) / Garden Ops</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4337_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4337_Annotation8" targetRef="W4337_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
