    <bpmn:process id="W_W4338" name="W4338. Live Plant Sourcing, Grower/Vendor Management &amp; Phytosanitary Compliance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Sourcing cycle; new grower; seasonal buy
Frequency: Per sourcing cycle + ongoing vendor mgmt
Volume: Live-goods grower/vendor base (local + import)
Owner: Garden Buyer / Vendor Mgmt (VS-03) / Quality (VS-31)
Participants: Vendor (VS-03), Quality (VS-31), Supply (VS-02), Customs (VS-87 for import), Compliance (BPI/phytosanitary VS-22)
Source: workflow W4338 — Live Plant Sourcing, Grower/Vendor Management &amp; Phytosanitary Compliance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4338_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4338_Lane1" name="Garden Buyer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4338_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4338_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4338_Lane2" name="Quality">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4338_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4338_Lane3" name="Supply">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4338_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4338_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4338_Start5" name="Sourcing cycle; new grower; seasonal buy">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4338_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4338_Task6" name="Garden Buyer/Vendor Mgmt source &amp; qualify growers (capacity, quality…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Garden Buyer/Vendor Mgmt source &amp; qualify growers (capacity, quality, certification, pest-free status, sustainability), and negotiate seasonal capacity + standing orders
Responsible (R): Garden Buyer / Vendor Mgmt
Accountable (A): Head of Merch
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4338_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4338_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4338_Task7" name="Quality/Compliance verify phytosanitary compliance — BPI (Bureau of Plant…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Quality/Compliance verify phytosanitary compliance — BPI (Bureau of Plant Industry) import permit &amp; phytosanitary certificate for imported live plants, pest-free status, restricted-species check (W4357)
Responsible (R): Quality / Compliance
Accountable (A): Quality Lead / Compliance Lead
Duration: Per shipment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4338_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4338_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4338_Task8" name="Supply/Vendor manage grower relationships, forecast communication, and grower…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Supply/Vendor manage grower relationships, forecast communication, and grower scorecard (survival-on-arrival, fill, quality)
Responsible (R): Supply / Vendor Mgmt
Accountable (A): Head of Merch
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4338_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4338_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4338_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4338_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4338_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-91 (ensure live-goods compliance &amp; inventory accuracy.) | - CTL-665: growers qualified &amp; scored; phytosanitary/BPI compliance for imports; restricted-species gated (W4357)
Owner: Garden Buyer / Vendor Mgmt (VS-03) / Quality (VS-31)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
