      <bpmn:userTask id="W4341_Task6" name="Pricing/Garden set live-goods pricing (cost + perishability + care-cost…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Pricing/Garden set live-goods pricing (cost + perishability + care-cost premium) and the markdown-on-decline ladder (healthy → slight-decline → marked-down → clearance → dispose)
Responsible (R): Pricing / Garden Ops
Accountable (A): Head of Merch / CFO
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4341_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4341_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
