        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Garden Ops apply decline-triggered markdown per the ladder as plants age/stress (W4354), and document markdown reason/grade for margin &amp; vendor-consignment attribution
Responsible (R): Garden Ops
Accountable (A): Garden Ops Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4341_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4341_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4341_Task8" name="Finance/RA track live-goods markdown/shrink margin impact, detect leakage…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance/RA track live-goods markdown/shrink margin impact, detect leakage (un-marked decline sold at full price, or over-markdown), and feed prevention
Responsible (R): Finance / RA
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4341_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4341_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
