        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Garden Buyer/Vendor structure the consignment/pay-by-scan arrangement (BuildRight sells, consignor owns until scan; or VMI replenishment), with mortality/attribution terms
Responsible (R): Garden Buyer / Vendor / Legal
Accountable (A): Head of Merch / VP Legal
Duration: Per arrangement</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4342_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4342_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
