        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Garden Ops track consignment stock separately (ownership until sell-through), scan-sell at POS, and attribute mortality/markdown (BuildRight vs consignor) per terms
Responsible (R): Garden Ops / Finance
Accountable (A): Garden Ops Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4342_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4342_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4342_Task8" name="Finance/Vendor settle consignment periodically (sell-through vs scan…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance/Vendor settle consignment periodically (sell-through vs scan, mortality/return to consignor, markdown share), reconcile, and pay per VS-45
Responsible (R): Finance / Vendor Mgmt
Accountable (A): Finance Mgr
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4342_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4342_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
