Frequency: Per seasonal event
Volume: Seasonal garden programs × events/yr
Owner: Garden Buyer / Marketing (VS-14) / Garden Ops
Participants: Merchandising (VS-01), Marketing (VS-14), Supply (VS-02), Store Ops (VS-07), Garden Ops
Source: workflow W4344 — Seasonal Garden Program, Promotions &amp; Calendar Planning</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4344_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4344_Lane1" name="Garden Buyer">
