        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-665 (ensure controlled execution — Live-Goods Assortment, Sourcing &amp; Nursery Operations (PA-145.1).) | - CTL-665: seasonal program sized to sell-through/clear target; land-dates managed; post-event cleared (W4341)
Owner: Garden Buyer / Marketing (VS-14) / Garden Ops</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
